Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:24.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.97,0:01:51.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, my dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.51,0:01:55.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My dearest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.30,0:01:57.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我警告过你 我说过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I warned you, I said, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.98,0:02:00.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}千万不要走近悬崖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}do not go to near the edge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.04,0:02:05.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你为什么推我 巴伦？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why did you push me Baron?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.63,0:02:11.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的太太 你是在做梦呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dear wife, you're dreaming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.18,0:02:16.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 你撒谎… 撒谎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.You're lying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.64,0:02:21.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 我亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, my darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.00,0:03:05.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《显贵的主顾》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.82,0:03:14.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有什么激动人心的事吗 福尔摩斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anything stirring Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.20,0:03:18.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我了解的就这么多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know no more than this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.25,0:03:23.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许是一个自大的傻胖子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There may be some fatty self-important fool, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.33,0:03:25.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许是一件生死攸关的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it may be a matter of life or death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.76,0:03:28.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 你同意会面了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mmm, you grant this interview?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.75,0:03:30.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经确认过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've already confirmed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.59,0:03:31.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于这个人你有什么了解吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you know anything of the man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.98,0:03:34.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只知道陆军上校詹姆斯达米里爵士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only that the name Colonel Sir James Damery{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.45,0:03:36.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是一个家喻户晓的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is a household word in society.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.09,0:03:38.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以告诉你更多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can tell you a little bit more than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.69,0:03:40.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他擅长处理棘手而微妙的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has rather the reputation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.09,0:03:41.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因而名声在外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for arranging delicate matters, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.68,0:03:43.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些事情是不为媒体所知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}which are to be kept out of the papers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.89,0:03:47.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他举世闻名 在外交方面天赋过人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's a man of the world with a natural turn for diplomacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.35,0:03:49.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我们可以认为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then, therefore to hope{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.79,0:03:52.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不是一个错误的警报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it is not a false scent, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.11,0:03:55.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他应该真的需要我们的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that he has some real need of our assistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.56,0:03:58.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.65,0:04:01.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 华生 要是你能好心帮帮忙的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you'll be so good Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.51,0:04:03.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很荣幸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall be honored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.21,0:04:06.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么在四点半以前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then until four-thirty o'clock{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.77,0:04:09.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们可以暂时把这事抛在脑后了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we can put the matter out of our heads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.50,0:04:15.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:20.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这次我们要对付的是欧洲最危险的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we are dealing on this occasion with the most dangerous man in Europe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.35,0:04:21.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我曾经有几个对手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've had several opponents{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.80,0:04:23.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也可以被冠之以这样的称呼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to whom that flattering term has been applied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.84,0:04:26.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是一个暴徒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man to whom violence is familiar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:29.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杀人不眨眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and who will literally stick at nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.16,0:04:30.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您不抽烟吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you smoke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:32.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请原谅我抽烟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excuse my pipe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.36,0:04:34.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是您说的这个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But if your man is more dangerous{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.35,0:04:35.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比已故的莫里亚蒂教授还要危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than the late Professor Moriarty, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.84,0:04:36.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那他就真值得会上一会了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he's indeed worth meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.99,0:04:38.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他叫什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I ask his name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.23,0:04:40.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您听说过巴伦 格鲁纳吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you ever heard of Baron Gruner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.35,0:04:44.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个奥地利的杀人犯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Austrian murderer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.26,0:04:47.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么您已经把他列为杀人犯了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you've already sized him up as a murderer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.07,0:04:51.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的业务就是关注欧洲大陆各种罪案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is our business to follow the details of Continental crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.09,0:04:53.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在斯普拉根隘道那起所谓的事故中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sure that he killed his wife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.27,0:04:54.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正是他杀了他的妻子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when that so called accident happened{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.92,0:04:57.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对此我毫不怀疑 就像亲眼所见一般{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at the Splugen Pass as if I'd seen him do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.83,0:04:58.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还肯定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just as I am certain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.99,0:05:01.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是他除掉了唯一的目击证人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that he disposed the only witness, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.26,0:05:03.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个无辜的牧童{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that innocent shepherd boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.70,0:05:05.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巴伦 格鲁纳现在在英国{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Baron Gruner is now in England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.78,0:05:08.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他听说他就住在金斯顿附近？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Residing near Kingston I'm informed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.95,0:05:10.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.50,0:05:12.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想您应该{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Might I also suppose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.11,0:05:14.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也听说过梅维尔将军的名字吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you will have heard of General Merville?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.82,0:05:17.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他以前是个风云人物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Khyber Pass fame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.21,0:05:19.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.30,0:05:23.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}梅维尔将军有个女儿叫维奥莱特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}General Merville has a daughter, Violet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.31,0:05:26.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}年轻 富有 多才多艺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Young, rich, accomplished, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.19,0:05:28.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管从哪方面看 都是个非凡的女孩儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a wonder woman in every way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:30.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她是个单纯的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is she an innocent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:34.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们要努力把她从那个魔鬼手里救出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we are endeavoring to save from the clutches of this fiend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:36.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他控制着她吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has some hold over her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.18,0:05:39.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 对女人最有力的控制就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The strongest of all where women are concerned, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.54,0:05:42.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈 爱情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.74,0:05:44.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.91,0:05:48.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的 要是我娶了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In marrying you, my darling, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.33,0:05:52.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我过去的罪恶就可以得到宽恕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}all my past sins shall be absolved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.20,0:05:54.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你告诉我的那些并不是什么罪恶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These aren't sins you've told me of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.15,0:05:56.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些都是诽谤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These are slanders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:05:57.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的天使{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.93,0:06:01.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟所有伟人一样 你当时被诱入歧途了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were seduced, as are all great men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:04.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然而我还是决定让你知道我的过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I am determined you shall know my history, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.39,0:06:05.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}详详细细地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}every part of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.88,0:06:07.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那样的话 当我步上圣坛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thus shall I come to the altar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.55,0:06:08.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}心境澄明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}purified in soul and spirit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.98,0:06:13.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最终我才对得起你的爱 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and worthy at last of your love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.39,0:06:15.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过是六个星期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just six weeks, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:17.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 阿德尔伯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh Adelbert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.23,0:06:25.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不能假装过去清白无暇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot pretend my past is without stain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.84,0:06:28.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有一个出身贫困{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No man born in poverty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.36,0:06:30.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而又白手起家的人可以那样说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who has created his own fortune{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.42,0:06:32.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说实话吧 不是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}can say that and speak the truth, oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.52,0:06:36.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我曾经被迫做出不少无情的事情 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have been forced to many a ruthless act, my dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:38.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我该从哪儿说起呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where shall I begin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.68,0:06:45.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 看到有人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To observe, Mr. Holmes, an atrocious event, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.13,0:06:47.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在您眼前谋划着一起残忍的罪行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}preparing itself before your very eyes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.19,0:06:49.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}却无力改变它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and yet be powerless to avert it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.07,0:06:51.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有任何人面对过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Could anyone, any human being{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.96,0:06:54.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比这更难受的事情吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}be placed in a more trying position?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.32,0:06:55.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.47,0:06:59.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么您应该能够同情 我当事人的处境{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well then you will sympathize with the client in whose interest I am acting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.66,0:07:02.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did not understand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.74,0:07:04.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您居然只是中间人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that you were merely an intermediary, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.03,0:07:07.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那谁是委托人呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who is the principal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.63,0:07:10.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我恳求您不要问这个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I beg of you not to press that question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:13.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的名字不能被牵扯进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His name cannot be dragged into this matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.71,0:07:16.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的动机是非常高尚的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His motives are to the last degree honorable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:18.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是他不想让别人知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but he prefers to remain unknown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.93,0:07:21.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而您的费用是不成问题 我可以保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I need not say that your fees will be assured, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.79,0:07:23.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.05,0:07:29.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且您不会受到任何约束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you will be allowed a free hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.75,0:07:35.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}委托人的名字又有何相关呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Surely the actual name of your client is immaterial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:36.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只能拒绝您的要求了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must decline to act, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.43,0:07:37.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}詹姆斯爵士 我很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir James, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.15,0:07:40.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我习惯了案件本身的迷雾重重{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm accustomed to having mystery at one end of my cases{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.55,0:07:43.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但连您这边也是 未免太让人困惑了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but to have it at both ends is too confusing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.13,0:07:44.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.53,0:07:50.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您让我太为难了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You place me in the most serious dilemma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:51.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dare I say, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.48,0:07:54.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得说您没有意识到您这样做的后果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you hardly realize the affect of your own action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:56.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我保证过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have given my word{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.15,0:07:59.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不泄露我当事人的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not to reveal the identity of my client.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.13,0:08:03.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能否允许我至少把可以讲的事 先告诉您？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I at the least lay all I can before you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.74,0:08:17.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您必须明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is understood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.73,0:08:18.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有做出任何承诺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I commit myself to nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.94,0:08:21.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是当然 我明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But of course, yes, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.20,0:08:25.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}画得太像了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A perfect likeness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.41,0:08:28.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是谁画的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who painted it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.66,0:08:30.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因斯布鲁克的汉斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hans of Innsbruck, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.10,0:08:33.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是雕刻家克劳斯的后代 以雕刻铜像而著称{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a descendant of Claus the sculptor famous for his bronzes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.50,0:08:34.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像这尊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}such as this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.03,0:08:41.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我将委托汉斯来为你 画一幅肖像 我亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall commission Hans to attempt your likeness, my precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.65,0:08:44.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我爱这个房间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love this room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.20,0:08:47.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到处都有你的气息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It breathes of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:56.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是什么呀？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.62,0:08:59.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的日记吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your diary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.15,0:09:01.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 它是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no, it is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.60,0:09:04.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是我的日常记事本{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it is my commonplace book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.03,0:09:07.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}里面记录着我看过的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In it I record things I've seen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:08.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}读过的和欣赏的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}read, admired, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.91,0:09:11.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许有时还有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}occasionally perhaps{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:13.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的一点儿想法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a thought or two of my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.47,0:09:16.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是它上了锁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But it's locked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.40,0:09:18.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它代表我的一部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a little part of me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.22,0:09:22.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}何况 我怕仆人会偷窥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}besides a servant might pry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.49,0:09:24.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一天 也许…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One day, perhaps, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.63,0:09:28.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们可以一起读一读{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we shall look at it together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.19,0:09:32.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我尊重你的隐私 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, I respect your privacy, my darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.01,0:09:35.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无论我们分享多少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must all keep something of our own, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.25,0:09:38.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}总该有一些自己保留的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}however much else we share.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.76,0:09:45.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你真是太完美了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.54,0:09:49.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你应该教我一些瓷器的知识 阿德尔伯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must teach me about porcelain, Adelbert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.88,0:09:51.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.51,0:09:53.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}收藏是一大乐事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Collecting is such a pleasure, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:54.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赏心悦目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}such a delight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.03,0:09:56.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}总能让我充满激情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it is a passion with me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.42,0:09:59.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像你一样 我亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}just as you are, my precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.07,0:10:02.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个恶棍黏上了这位女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The villain has attached himself to a lady{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.09,0:10:02.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且是彻彻底底{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with such effect that he has completely{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:06.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赢得了她的芳心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and absolutely won her heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:09.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对他不利的话她一句也不想听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She will not hear one word against him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.31,0:10:12.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}总而言之 她打算下个月就要嫁给他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To sum up, she proposes to marry him next month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.70,0:10:15.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她已经成年了而且意志坚决{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As she of age and has a will of iron{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.18,0:10:17.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真不知道如何阻止她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that's hard to know how to prevent her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.37,0:10:21.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个被爱冲昏头脑的女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does the infatuated young woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.10,0:10:22.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}知道发生在瑞士的那件事情吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}know of the Swiss episode?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.72,0:10:23.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个狡诈的恶魔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The cunning devil{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.48,0:10:26.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把他过去所有令人厌恶的丑事都告诉了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has told her every unsavory scandal of his past life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.42,0:10:28.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是总把自己说成是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but always in such a way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.10,0:10:31.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无辜的受害者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as to make himself out to be the innocent martyr.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.80,0:10:33.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她完全听信于他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She accepts his version{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.20,0:10:34.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别人的话也不听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and will listen to no one, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.35,0:10:36.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}连长辈们的话也听不进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not even her fathers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.33,0:10:37.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天哪 詹姆斯爵士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dear me, Sir James, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.58,0:10:41.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您是不是不小心泄露了 你的委托人的名字？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}have you not inadvertently let out the name of your client?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.46,0:10:42.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将军吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The General?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.48,0:10:43.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 不 华生医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh no, Dr. Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:48.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那位坚强的军人受此打击 已经一蹶不振了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that strong soldier has been utterly demoralized by this incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.45,0:10:55.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.84,0:10:56.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您摁铃了吗 先生？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You rang, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.99,0:10:57.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能不能麻烦你把这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will you deliver this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.89,0:10:59.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}送到街角屠夫家的男孩那儿？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the butcher's boy around the corner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.34,0:11:01.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个一只眼睛长得很可笑的小坏蛋吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That young rascal with the funny eye?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.74,0:11:04.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另一只眼睛却是无价之宝啊 还有他的自行车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The other is invaluable, so is his bicycle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.39,0:11:06.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.97,0:11:16.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我该怎么联系您呢 詹姆斯爵士？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How may I keep in touch with you, Sir James?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.82,0:11:17.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您接受我的委托了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You accept my commission?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.04,0:11:22.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不妨说是您的问题引起了我的兴趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us just say that your problem interests me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:23.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}通过卡尔顿俱乐部可以找到我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Carlton Club will find me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.10,0:11:26.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巴伦在金斯顿的具体地址是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the Baron's exact address in Kingston?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.50,0:11:27.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗农宅邸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vernon Lodge, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.61,0:11:29.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一座大宅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the large house, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.08,0:11:30.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个有钱人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he's a rich man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:33.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊哈 投机者在成功的时候都是有钱人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Uh-huh, speculators when successful frequently are, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.17,0:11:34.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}詹姆斯爵士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir James, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.18,0:11:35.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您还能提供{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what further information{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.41,0:11:36.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更多有关这个人的信息吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}can you give us about the man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.92,0:11:38.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的嗜好所费不菲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has expensive tastes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.55,0:11:40.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}收藏书籍 绘画{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Collects books, pictures, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.12,0:11:41.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 还有中国瓷器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}oh, and Chinese pottery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.86,0:11:43.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是这方面公认的权威{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's a recognized authority, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.82,0:11:46.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}写过一本相关的书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}written a book upon the subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.15,0:11:47.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}詹姆斯爵士 您可以告诉您的委托人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, Sir James, you may tell your client{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.89,0:11:50.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会开始注意巴伦 格鲁纳的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I'm turning my attention towards Baron Gruner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:52.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 我毫不怀疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have no doubt, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.61,0:11:53.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您不费吹灰之力就可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you can easily{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.72,0:11:55.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}追查出我的委托人的身份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}trace my client.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.08,0:11:57.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我必须请求您以名誉担保{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I must ask you as a point of honor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.13,0:11:59.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请您不要这样做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to refrain from doing so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.53,0:12:03.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要去挖出他的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not, I beg you, break in upon his incognito.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.85,0:12:05.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想这点我可以保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think I can safely promise that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:06.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:09.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见 医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.47,0:12:31.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这是在浪费时间 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're wasting your time, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.59,0:12:33.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}梅维尔将军的生涯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now the career of General Merville{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.07,0:12:35.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许正好帮我们查出我们委托人的身份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}might well give us a pointer as to our client.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.22,0:12:36.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是如此杰出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's clearly illustrious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.42,0:12:37.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是您没有听到詹姆斯爵士说的话吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But did you not hear, Sir James?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.67,0:12:40.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他要求的是你 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His request was to you, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.11,0:12:42.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样做不光彩 华生 不光彩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But that is shameful, Watson, shameful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.05,0:12:45.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再说我们的脑子要用在更有价值的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}besides our minds should be more gainfully employed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.98,0:12:47.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}打消这念头吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}desist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.94,0:12:53.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对这件事你有什么看法吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Any views?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.85,0:12:54.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你没有吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you none?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.98,0:12:56.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.93,0:12:58.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有一个想法 我已经着手行事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Beyond the one I've already acted upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.96,0:13:00.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}屠夫家的男孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The butcher's boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.41,0:13:03.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样做比发电报谨慎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More discreet than any telegraph.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.93,0:13:06.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 我倒是觉得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, I shall think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.39,0:13:09.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你最好亲自去见见这位年轻女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you better see the young lady yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.56,0:13:11.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从她入手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Start with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.20,0:13:12.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 要是那可怜的崩溃了的父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, if her poor broken down father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.63,0:13:13.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都不能说服她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}cannot move her, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.38,0:13:15.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我这样一个陌生人又怎能成功呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}how can I, a complete stranger prevail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.52,0:13:17.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 要是所有做法都不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, if all else fails, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.27,0:13:19.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许我会去的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:23.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是首先要利用下层社会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But first, the underworld.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.52,0:13:26.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为他们能接触到犯罪的邪恶本质{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For it is among the dark roots of crime{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.23,0:13:28.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们必须搜寻格鲁纳的秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that we must hunt for Gruner's secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.17,0:13:34.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你已经派人去找欣韦尔约翰逊了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've sent for Shinwell Johnson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:37.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有一个想法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have but one insight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.74,0:13:41.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}梅维尔小姐也许能够宽恕谋杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that Ms. Merville might well condone murder{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.65,0:13:47.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但不会原谅某些更小的风流韵事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yet some smaller affair that might...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.30,0:13:50.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们走着瞧吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.32,0:13:57.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们请到了最好的侦探{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They have engaged the very best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.23,0:14:00.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让他进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Show him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.23,0:14:09.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位是歇洛克.福尔摩斯先生 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Sherlock Holmes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.65,0:14:23.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我早知道我们迟早会见面 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I rather thought I should see you sooner or later, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.14,0:14:32.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你肯定是受到了梅维尔将军的委托吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've been retained no doubt by General Merville{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.11,0:14:35.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来阻止我和他女儿维奥莱特的婚事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to prevent my marriage with his daughter, Violet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.41,0:14:40.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是这样的吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is so, is it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.21,0:14:48.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 我竭力劝告您{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me advise you very strongly, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.70,0:14:50.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就此罢手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to draw off at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.31,0:14:51.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罢手？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Draw off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.83,0:14:53.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My dear man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.48,0:14:55.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那不仅会毁掉你的好名声{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you'll only ruin your well-deserved reputation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.78,0:14:56.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这件事情上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is not a case{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.69,0:14:59.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是没有希望成功的 罢手吧 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in which you can possibly hope to succeed, draw off sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.95,0:15:01.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听上去有些奇怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is curious{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.09,0:15:03.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过这也正是我要给你的忠告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but that is the very advice that I've come to give you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.18,0:15:06.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我坦率地说了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me put it to you man to man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.44,0:15:07.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你坚持要缔结这桩婚事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you persist in this marriage, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.01,0:15:11.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你将会树起无数劲敌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you will raise such a swarm of powerful enemies, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.29,0:15:13.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到时连在英国的立足之地都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}England would be too hot to hold you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.10,0:15:18.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你就此罢手将会是更明智的做法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Surely you will be wiser to draw off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.36,0:15:25.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}原谅我的忍俊不禁 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excuse my amusement, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.12,0:15:26.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}手上没有牌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but it really is very funny{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.57,0:15:29.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}却想赌上一把 这实在太滑稽了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}seeing you trying to play a hand with no cards in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.97,0:15:31.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}连一张大牌都没有 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not a color card there, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.69,0:15:33.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了小之又小的牌 你什么也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}nothing but the smallest of the small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.34,0:15:34.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你自以为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.10,0:15:35.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是'认为' 先生 是'知道'{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So I know, sir, so I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.94,0:15:37.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我明白地告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me make the thing clear to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.50,0:15:39.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得自己胜券在握{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You consider your hand so strong{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.36,0:15:41.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我看见了也无妨吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that you could afford to show it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.34,0:15:43.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然了 因为事情是明摆着的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Certainly, since it becomes plain that in this instance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.80,0:15:46.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这件事上你完全无能为力 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you are clearly out of your depth, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.51,0:15:50.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有没有可能你的能力被夸大了呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Could it be that your capabilities have been subject to hyperbole?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.34,0:15:54.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的一手牌呢 给我看吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your hand, show it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.10,0:15:56.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不坐下来吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Won't you sit down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.71,0:15:59.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想还是不要了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think I shan't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.71,0:16:03.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就随你的便{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.50,0:16:08.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.31,0:16:13.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我碰巧就是很走运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it happens I have been fortunate enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.72,0:16:17.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赢得了梅维尔小姐全心的爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to win the entire affection of Ms. Merville.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.62,0:16:18.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管我曾经清楚地对她讲过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This in spite of the fact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.86,0:16:21.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过去发生在我身上的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I have informed her clearly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.34,0:16:26.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有那些不令人愉快的事件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of all the unhappy incidents in my past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.93,0:16:31.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还警告她说 某些耍阴谋的人会去找她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have warned her that certain designing persons would come to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.32,0:16:34.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望你认清这一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hope you recognize yourself in this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.03,0:16:37.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并把这些事情告诉她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and would tell her of these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.67,0:16:42.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经教过她如何来对付这些事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have instructed her how to treat them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.63,0:16:45.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她对你的拜访已经做好准备了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is well prepared for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.80,0:16:52.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她肯定会答应见你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She will no doubt give you an appointment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.93,0:16:54.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且听完你的陈述{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and she will listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.07,0:16:57.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你的所作所为都是徒劳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will be to no avail, however.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.33,0:17:02.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是你想说些什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you wish to speak, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.51,0:17:04.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在正是时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}now is your moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.59,0:17:07.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.02,0:17:10.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还不到时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this is not the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.76,0:17:16.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}顺便说一句 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, by the way, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.07,0:17:20.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你认识法国侦探拉博朗吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}did you know the French Agent Labrun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.07,0:17:21.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然认识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.50,0:17:24.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你也知道他出了什么事情吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So you know what befell him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.24,0:17:27.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在巴黎的拉蒙特区遭到了毒打{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was beaten in the Lamont District of Paris{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.27,0:17:29.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}落下了终生残废{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and crippled for life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.11,0:17:29.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quite so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.87,0:17:31.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奇怪的巧合是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By an odd coincidence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:33.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他之前同样在调查我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he had been inquiring into my affairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.68,0:17:36.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是别那样做的好 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't do it, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.51,0:17:37.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那样做不吉利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's not a lucky thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.87,0:17:39.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的最后忠告是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My last word to you is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.40,0:17:43.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你走你的阳关道 我走我的独木桥吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you go your way, let me go mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.24,0:17:46.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好自为之吧 格鲁纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mind you Gruner, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.62,0:17:50.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你指望为英国社交界所接受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}because if you aspire to be accepted into English Society{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.22,0:17:51.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你就要学会在点雪茄之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you'll do well to remove the band{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.64,0:17:53.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先把外头的标签去掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from your Havana before lighting it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.40,0:17:56.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则人家会把你当成一个暴发户而瞧不起你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}otherwise you'll be put down for a bounder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.69,0:18:13.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太 福尔摩斯回来了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mrs. Hudson, has Holmes returned?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.61,0:18:16.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还没呢 先生 不过有两个客人在等着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not yet, sir, but there are two visitors waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.03,0:18:18.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 哈德森太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.27,0:18:26.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 约翰逊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why Johnson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.32,0:18:27.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚上好 医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Evening, Doctor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.33,0:18:28.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生给我捎话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes sent word to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.79,0:18:29.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道 约翰逊 我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know, Johnson, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.72,0:18:31.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还把基特带来了 因为…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I brought Kit here because...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.31,0:18:32.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在博物馆耽搁了一会儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's when I was delayed at the museum{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.78,0:18:34.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后又是交通{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and then the traffic, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.95,0:18:37.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有辆马车在大罗素街翻车了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}an omnibus overturned on Great Russell Street, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.95,0:18:40.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们得拖走两匹死马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}two dead a horse had to be put down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.29,0:18:41.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请原谅 先生们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gentlemen forgive me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.33,0:18:43.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我沉浸在自己的谜题中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was absorbed by the mysteries of me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.42,0:18:45.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而忘记了时间 女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I quite forgotten the hour, madam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.68,0:18:48.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是温特小姐 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is Ms. Winter, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.25,0:18:49.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们叫她基蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kitty we call her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.35,0:18:50.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于格鲁纳她没有什么不知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and what she don't know about Gruner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.69,0:18:52.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然了 请讲吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.27,0:18:53.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 基蒂自己可以讲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, Kitty can speak for herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.84,0:18:55.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管怎么说 一接到您的口信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anyway I put me hand right on her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.84,0:18:57.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个钟头之内我就找到她了 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}within an hour of your message, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.22,0:18:58.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很容易就能找到我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm easy to find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.77,0:19:01.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}该死的 伦敦次次都让我犯迷糊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hell, London gets me every time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.45,0:19:03.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小胖也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}same address goes for Porky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.11,0:19:06.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小胖？那是你的外号吗 约翰逊？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Porky, is that your nom-de-guerre Johnson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.42,0:19:08.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可从没说起过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have never revealed that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.33,0:19:10.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小胖 哈哈哈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Porky, well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.88,0:19:13.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小胖和我是老相识了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're old mates, Porky and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.80,0:19:16.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是还有一个人 该下到比我们更深的地狱去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But there's someone who ought to be down in a lower hell than us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.98,0:19:19.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个人就是你在调查的人 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and that's the man you're after, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.12,0:19:20.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想我们能得到你帮助的吧 温特小姐？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I gather we have your good wishes, Ms. Winter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.98,0:19:22.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是我能帮上忙让他露出原形{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I can help put him where he belongs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.80,0:19:25.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我任您差遣 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm yours to the rattle, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.82,0:19:26.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道他的企图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you know what he intends, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.97,0:19:29.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和目前的情况吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}how the matter stands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.61,0:19:32.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小胖说他又追上了某个可怜的傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Porky tells me he's after some other poor fool{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.20,0:19:35.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只不过这次他想娶她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}only this time he wants to marry her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.08,0:19:36.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而您想阻止他？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and you want to stop it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.08,0:19:37.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.46,0:19:39.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您对这个恶棍肯定有足够的了解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Surely you know enough about this devil{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.75,0:19:41.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去阻止任何头脑清醒的正派女子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to prevent any decent girl in her senses{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.48,0:19:43.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陷入与他的纠葛之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}wanting to have anything to do with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.17,0:19:45.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是她现在脑子并不清醒 温特小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But she's not in her senses, Ms. Winter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.81,0:19:46.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她狂热地爱着他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she's madly in love{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.91,0:19:49.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且她也听说过他的那些事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and she has been told all about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.56,0:19:50.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是她不在乎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She cares for nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.46,0:19:52.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她也知道他杀过自己的妻子吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Told about the murder of his wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.78,0:19:54.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.76,0:19:57.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天哪 她肯定有很坚强的神经{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lord, she must have a nerve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.77,0:19:59.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确实如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.45,0:20:01.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您就不能把证据给她看吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can't you lay proofs before her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.70,0:20:03.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能否帮我们这样做？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can you help us do so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.79,0:20:05.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就是一个证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am proof, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.74,0:20:07.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}活生生的证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}living proof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.71,0:20:12.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是我能站在她面前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I was to stand before her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.61,0:20:14.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉她我是如何被他利用的就好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and tell her how he used me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.78,0:20:16.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你愿意吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would you do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.04,0:20:18.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would I, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.78,0:20:20.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难道会不愿意吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would I not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.60,0:20:22.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许值得一试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It might be worth the trying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.35,0:20:25.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 不 他没有把全部都告诉她 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh no he didn't tell her all, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.60,0:20:29.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}全部？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.51,0:20:32.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他收藏了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He collected me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.45,0:20:35.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他收藏女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he collects women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.62,0:20:38.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是一个绘画模特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was an artist's model, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.76,0:20:40.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个受人尊敬的绘画模特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a respectable artist's model.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.63,0:20:41.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.13,0:20:42.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他书房里的那副肖像 就是以你为模特的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you sat for that painting in his study.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.81,0:20:45.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你去过金斯顿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've been to Kingston, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.73,0:20:48.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你也看过他的坛坛罐罐了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then you'll have seen all his crocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.76,0:20:50.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女人和瓷器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Women and china, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.56,0:20:52.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他酷爱的两样东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they're his twin passions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.48,0:20:55.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}格鲁纳请别人画了这幅画{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gruner commissioned that painting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.23,0:20:57.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and afterwards, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.43,0:21:00.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}之后…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and after...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.38,0:21:05.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 我们就这么说吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}well, let's just say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.92,0:21:08.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在那之后我就再也无法工作了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can never work again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.37,0:21:10.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再也工作不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.75,0:21:14.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再也…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.56,0:21:21.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对你十分感谢 温特小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am exceedingly obliged to you, Ms. Winter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.32,0:21:25.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们会让你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we shall indeed interview you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.52,0:21:27.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟梅维尔小姐见面的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and Ms. Merville together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.11,0:21:30.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的委托人会对你做出大方的补偿的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My client will compensate you most liberally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.17,0:21:31.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 福尔摩斯先生 用不着的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, none of that, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.46,0:21:33.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我又不缺钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not out for money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.76,0:21:36.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就想看着这个人跌进泥潭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just let me see this man in the mud, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.72,0:21:39.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我给他的脸狠狠地踩上一脚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the mud with my foot in his face{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.36,0:21:41.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就满足了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that's my price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.65,0:21:55.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.70,0:22:12.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来自金斯顿的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From Kingston.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.89,0:22:15.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 哈德森太太 我不回复了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, Mrs. Hudson, no reply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.94,0:22:17.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们去吃饭吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shall we dine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.84,0:22:23.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可这是一封死亡威胁啊 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is a death threat, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.01,0:22:26.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还能指望巴伦格鲁纳给我发来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you expect anything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.01,0:22:27.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么更友善的东西吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}less from Baron Gruner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.62,0:22:28.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 还是小心为好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes, have a care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.92,0:22:31.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 华生 走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, Watson, come along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.17,0:22:33.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们得吃东西了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.46,0:22:57.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快跑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.96,0:23:43.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们没有跟上来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They ain't following no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.44,0:23:45.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}千万别这么想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't you believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.18,0:23:51.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说得没错吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What'd I say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.62,0:23:54.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你站到一边去 基蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now you stand over there, Kitty, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.64,0:23:56.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样才是个好女孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there's a good girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.22,0:24:01.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧 谁先上 你吗？还是你？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right, who's first, you or you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.97,0:24:41.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}业余选手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Amateurs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.08,0:24:42.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都是些生手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they've done no time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.21,0:24:44.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么也不懂 我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}don't know nothing, come on girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.63,0:26:53.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有两个人想见您 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's two persons wish to see you sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.91,0:26:54.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Persons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.97,0:26:58.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坦白地说 恐怕不能算是什么绅士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I couldn't in honesty term them gentlemen, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.04,0:27:02.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.36,0:27:21.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他带着武器吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was he armed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.27,0:27:23.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.31,0:27:26.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到厨房里去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go through to the kitchens, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.71,0:27:29.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把自己好好洗干净{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}clean yourselves up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.09,0:27:31.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and clear out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.22,0:27:56.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是出于对我父亲的尊敬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have agreed to this visit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.47,0:27:58.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}才同意与你会面的 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}out of respect for my father, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.42,0:27:59.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样做可不是为了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}rather than for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.60,0:28:01.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的未婚夫对我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My fianc?assures me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.68,0:28:03.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你已经不是原来的你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you are no longer what you were, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.10,0:28:05.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有钱能使鬼推磨啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a spent force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.56,0:28:07.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而温特小姐你…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you, Ms. Winter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.70,0:28:12.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的出现应该是毫无必要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}surely you must also be superfluous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.37,0:28:15.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们完全是出于好意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our intentions are the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.54,0:28:17.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们是来帮你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are here to aid you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.00,0:28:19.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是嘛？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.75,0:28:21.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们到这儿来诽谤我的未婚夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When you call to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.48,0:28:22.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也算是好意吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}malign my fianc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.58,0:28:27.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}梅维尔小姐 我不是以富有爱心而出名的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am not renowned, Ms. Merville, for the warmth of my affections{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.13,0:28:29.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我却能欣赏别人的爱心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I can appreciate them in others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.99,0:28:31.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我有个女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Had I a daughter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.80,0:28:35.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会为她着想的 就像将军为你那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should, I hope feel for you as the General does, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.57,0:28:38.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的关切也不是没有根据的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}nor is our concern without foundation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.27,0:28:41.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看来你已经开始在恶意中伤了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There, the slander begins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.54,0:28:42.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非也 我并非那种会轻易上门拜访{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, I do not readily call upon anyone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.01,0:28:44.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并且去恳求别人的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to beg or to plead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.68,0:28:46.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但事关巴伦 格鲁纳 请你认真听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but in Baron Gruner, please, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.40,0:28:47.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从来都不会毫无根据地乱说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never speak idly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.94,0:28:52.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你选择了他 既不明智又很危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've chosen not only unwisely but dangerously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.92,0:28:56.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}梅维尔小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Marry him, Ms. Merville, and I assure you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.84,0:28:58.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}根据我对犯罪心理的了解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with all the knowledge I have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.30,0:29:00.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你嫁给他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the criminal mentality, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.04,0:29:03.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我敢说你将面临极大的危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you will be in mortal danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.37,0:29:06.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会落得前男爵夫人那样的下场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just as the former baroness was, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.24,0:29:08.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她也是太为他着迷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she too was infatuated, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.02,0:29:10.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以致付出了死亡的代价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and paid the fatal price, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.77,0:29:13.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用她的性命为他换来了一大笔财产{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}her life for a fortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.14,0:29:16.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}满口谎言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's a lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.81,0:29:20.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你应该注意到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are of course aware{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.27,0:29:22.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯普拉根隘道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that the Splugen Pass{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.04,0:29:23.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是连接意大利和瑞士的吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}where your predecessor died{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.79,0:29:27.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是他的前一任夫人死去的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}runs between Italy and Switzerland?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.23,0:29:29.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这跟地理学又有什么关系？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What does the geography matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.73,0:29:31.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你打算把一个无助的女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A great deal, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.98,0:29:33.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从一个国家境内的悬崖推下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when you plan to hurl a helpless woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.88,0:29:34.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而正好让她在另一个国家摔断脖子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}off a cliff in one country{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.92,0:29:36.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那地理学的关系可就大得很了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to break her neck in another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.70,0:29:38.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但那只是一起意外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But it was an accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.29,0:29:40.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那为什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then why did the shepherd boy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.83,0:29:42.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个目睹男爵夫人坠崖的牧童{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who saw the baroness fall{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.47,0:29:45.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会死于砒霜中毒呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}die of arsenical poison?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.87,0:29:49.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谋杀他的女人便是受了格鲁纳的诱骗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His murderess whom Gruner had seduced{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.12,0:29:50.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她在审讯时供认{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}confessed at her trial{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.72,0:29:53.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是他威胁她去投毒的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that he'd obliged her to administer the fatal substance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.75,0:29:55.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不然的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or risk disfigurement for life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.71,0:29:58.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他就会用硫酸将她毁容{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by oil of vitriol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.84,0:30:02.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些都是事实 梅维尔小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Those are the facts, Ms. Merville.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.63,0:30:04.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我恳求你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I beg you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.09,0:30:06.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想象一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}picture the awful situation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.78,0:30:08.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是你在婚后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you will find yourself in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.36,0:30:12.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}才对你未婚夫的本性有清醒的认识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you only wake to your fianc?s true character{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.81,0:30:15.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那情形将会是多么可怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}after you have married him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.37,0:30:26.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一直在很耐心地听你说话 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have listened to you with patience, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.00,0:30:31.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道我未婚夫过去的生活颇为颠沛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am aware my fianc? has had a stormy life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.13,0:30:35.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}招致了许多非常不公平的中伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in which he has incurred most unjust aspersions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.97,0:30:37.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许你的用意是好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Possibly you mean well{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.67,0:30:39.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管我知道你只不过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}though I learn you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.57,0:30:40.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是人家花钱雇佣的侦探而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}are a paid agent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.90,0:30:45.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是不管怎么说我爱巴伦 格鲁纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but in any case I love Baron Gruner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.56,0:30:47.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而他也爱我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and he loves me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.31,0:30:52.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你已经向我介绍了这位女士的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have told me this young lady's name{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.96,0:30:55.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且说她的到来是有原因的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and that there is a reason for her presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.28,0:30:56.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确实是有原因的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll say there is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.79,0:30:58.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你到底是什么人 温特小姐？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what exactly are you, Ms. Winter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.62,0:31:02.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我吗？我来告诉你吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Me, I'll tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.35,0:31:04.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来告诉你我是什么人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll tell you what I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.32,0:31:06.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我曾经是他的情妇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was his mistress that's who, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.54,0:31:09.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是他上百个情妇中的一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}one of a hundred more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.18,0:31:10.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他引诱我们 利用我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's tempted, used, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.65,0:31:12.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毁掉我们 然后就把我们扔在一边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}ruined and thrown aside, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.03,0:31:13.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他也会这样对你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as he will you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.00,0:31:15.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}得了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.16,0:31:17.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要是嫁给他 你就完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You marry this man it'll be the death of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.66,0:31:18.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你最后从他那里得到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It may be a broken heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.94,0:31:21.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是一颗破碎的心就是一个折了的脖子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or a broken neck but he'll have you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.27,0:31:22.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 是嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.34,0:31:23.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也许觉得你跟别人不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You may think yourself different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.74,0:31:24.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好了 基蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, Kitty, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.58,0:31:27.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你已经说得够清楚的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you've made yourself admirably clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.31,0:31:30.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道 我未婚夫曾有三次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm aware of three occasions in my fianc?s life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.06,0:31:33.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被颇有心计的女人纠缠不休{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when he has become entangled with designing women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.42,0:31:36.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而他真心的悔悟已经使我放下心来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I'm assured by him of his hearty repentance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.75,0:31:38.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.13,0:31:39.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他会悔悟？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Repent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.45,0:31:41.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还说只有三个女人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And only three?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.96,0:31:43.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 你这个傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, you fool, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.54,0:31:45.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你真是个愚蠢的傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you stupid fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.38,0:31:46.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.48,0:31:49.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我遵照我父亲的意愿与你见面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have obeyed my father's wish in seeing you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.44,0:31:50.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我不想被迫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I'm not compelled to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.59,0:31:53.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去听这些话带诽谤的疯言疯语…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}listen to the slanderous ravings...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.52,0:31:54.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}疯言疯语？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ravings?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.51,0:31:57.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说我疯言疯语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ravings!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.46,0:32:00.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh my god, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.91,0:32:04.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要让你看个明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.04,0:32:13.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.89,0:32:16.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.07,0:32:20.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看见了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.04,0:32:26.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里 都是硫酸造成的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And here, oil of vitriol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.50,0:32:28.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是他干的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.55,0:32:32.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错 就是他干的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, yes, he did it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.63,0:32:34.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是你的未婚夫干的好事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your fianc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.77,0:32:36.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你骗人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's a lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.21,0:32:39.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你骗人 - 好了 基蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- It's a lie. - Thank you, Kitty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.40,0:32:50.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以告诉巴伦 不把他绳之以法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can tell the Baron that I shall not rest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.44,0:32:52.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我决不罢休{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until I bring him to justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.72,0:33:02.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}温特小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ms. Winter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.69,0:33:18.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么呢 基蒂 到底怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why Kitty, why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.92,0:33:20.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 请别再问了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.03,0:33:21.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么格鲁纳会这样对你？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why did Gruner treat you so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.57,0:33:24.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.37,0:33:26.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我说不出口 福尔摩斯先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}no, I can't tell you, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.09,0:33:27.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这节骨眼上你一定要告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must at this instant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.86,0:33:29.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说他收藏女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You said that he collects women, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.20,0:33:30.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what did you mean by that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.60,0:33:34.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他有一个本子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a book he has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.83,0:33:35.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个本子？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A book?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.81,0:33:39.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}褐色皮面的 还上了锁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Brown leather with a lock{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.62,0:33:41.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上面还有他的金色盾徽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and his coat of arms in gold on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.97,0:33:44.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我实在不该提起它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, I can't speak of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.47,0:33:46.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他对他的女人都做了记录吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He keeps a record of his women?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.26,0:33:49.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都在那个本子里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're all in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.05,0:33:53.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}照片 姓名 每人的详细情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Photographs, names, details, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.16,0:33:56.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有关我们的一切都在那里头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}everything about us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.81,0:33:58.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他要我念它们 在我和他…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He tried to make me read it while he...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.96,0:34:00.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我实在说不出口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}oh, no, I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.99,0:34:02.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当你拒绝的时候？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And when you refused?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.08,0:34:04.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他就开始发狂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He went berserk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.55,0:34:06.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他跑出了房间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He ran out of the room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.18,0:34:08.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我当时正要穿衣服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was trying to dress, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.12,0:34:10.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他就跑回来了 手里还拿着那个瓶子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he come back in with this bottle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.39,0:34:13.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我当时还半裸着身子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was half-naked{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.77,0:34:16.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他就把硫酸直接往我身上泼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and he threw it straight at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.65,0:34:20.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个本子在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is this book?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.16,0:34:21.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我不知道 - 你想啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I don't know. - Think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.58,0:34:22.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.95,0:34:24.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在书房里还是在卧室里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the study in the bedroom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.25,0:34:26.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是一年多以前的事情了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's more than a year since I was there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.55,0:34:27.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你可以记起来的 基蒂 想啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Than you can remember Kitty think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.98,0:34:30.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在书房里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the study, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.31,0:34:34.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在写字台的后面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}back of the bureau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.52,0:34:37.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 基蒂 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, Kitty, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.14,0:34:42.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}温特小姐的伤疤 也打动不了梅维尔小姐吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ms. Winter's scars could not move Ms. Merville?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.99,0:34:45.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她很震惊 但很快就平静了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was shocked but recovered instantly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.59,0:34:46.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good heavens, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.52,0:34:48.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}似乎太没人性了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it seems inhuman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.95,0:34:51.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我承认 我心里多少有些想看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I confess that part of me could wish{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.01,0:34:52.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她和格鲁纳的好戏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}her joy with Gruner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.76,0:34:53.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在知道了这件事情后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Abandon her to her fate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.96,0:34:55.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还任由她被命运摆布吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}after all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.59,0:34:57.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我把梅维尔小姐跟基蒂对比的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When I compare Ms. Merville with Kitty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.46,0:34:58.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我确实是这样想的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whose spirit is as fine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.51,0:34:59.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}基蒂的身体是受到玷污了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as her body is blemished, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.41,0:35:00.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可她的心灵还是纯洁的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.35,0:35:02.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不会放弃这个案子了吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You wouldn't withdraw from the case?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.39,0:35:03.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不用担心 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have no fear, Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.32,0:35:05.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对梅维尔小姐的厌恶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}my disgust with Ms. Merville{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.95,0:35:09.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与我要让格鲁纳受挫的决心相比 算不了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}counts as nothing against my determination to foil Gruner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.39,0:35:11.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一件事情让我懊恼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One thing irks me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.97,0:35:13.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是我初次与基蒂见面的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I've not paid more regard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.56,0:35:16.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有多留意她的举止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to Kitty's deportment when we first met, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.16,0:35:18.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有她头发的样式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the manner in which she dressed her hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.38,0:35:20.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 太晚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Huh, it's late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.29,0:35:24.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们该走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must be gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.05,0:35:29.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的诊所还有堆积如山的事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've got a mountain of work to do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.51,0:35:30.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要完成呢 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at the surgery Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.67,0:35:31.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明早再见你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so I'll see you in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.78,0:35:33.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那明天见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Until tomorrow then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.94,0:35:50.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好啊 歇洛克.福尔摩斯 看我们怎么收拾你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All right, Sherlock Holmes, let's be having you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.17,0:35:53.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 我知道是谁指使你们的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah and I can guess to whom I owe this pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.91,0:36:34.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}歇洛克.福尔摩斯受到致命袭击 看报看报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Read all about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.18,0:36:37.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}歇洛克.福尔摩斯受到致命袭击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Murderous attack on Sherlock Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.32,0:36:42.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}歇洛克.福尔摩斯受到致命袭击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}murderous attack on Sherlock Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.49,0:36:45.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看报看报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}read all about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.48,0:36:47.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}歇洛克.福尔摩斯受到致命袭击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Murderous attack on Sherlock Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.80,0:36:49.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看报看报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}read all about it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.24,0:36:52.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看报看报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}read all about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.49,0:36:54.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}歇洛克.福尔摩斯受到了致命袭击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Murderous attack on Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.75,0:37:15.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没事的 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's all right, Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.31,0:37:18.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别一副吓坏的样子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}don't look so scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.77,0:37:20.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不该说话的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You mustn't talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.35,0:37:24.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}胡说 我得说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nonsense, I need to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.30,0:37:28.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我该怎么做呢 福尔摩斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What can I do, Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.79,0:37:32.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肯定是那个该死的奥地利人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course it was that damned Austrian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.68,0:37:35.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你发话吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give me the word{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.58,0:37:37.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我马上去狠揍他一顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I'll go and thrash the hide off him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.50,0:37:39.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的好华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good old Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.58,0:37:41.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不不不 不用的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}no, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.95,0:37:44.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这两个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was it the same pair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.20,0:37:46.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是不是袭击约翰逊和温特小姐的那两个？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that attacked Johnson and Ms. Winter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.96,0:37:48.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一个也许是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One may have been, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.62,0:37:51.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另一个嘛 我怀疑不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the other I doubt it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.30,0:37:54.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过这个想法提醒了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.70,0:37:58.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们必须给约翰逊捎个口信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must send a note to Johnson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.24,0:38:02.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让他给基蒂在市郊 找一处安静的安身之所{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell him to find a quiet suburb for Kitty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.41,0:38:06.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她必须呆在那里 直到危险过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She should stay there until the danger has passed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.32,0:38:09.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.02,0:38:14.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们必须夸大我的伤势{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then we must exaggerate my injuries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.39,0:38:15.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没必要那样做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's no need for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.02,0:38:19.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就算如此 我们也得给媒体来点轰动的消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even so we must lay it on thick for the press.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.53,0:38:22.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也许活不过这个星期了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I might not live the week out, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.13,0:38:23.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}脑震荡 说胡话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}concussion, delirium, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.30,0:38:25.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想怎么说都行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't care what would you like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.36,0:38:30.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要让他们收到最沉重的消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They must receive the gravest bulletins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.34,0:38:32.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anything more?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.17,0:38:34.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.13,0:38:39.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把我的烟斗和烟条放在桌子上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Put my pipe on the table and the tobacco slip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.19,0:38:43.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你必须休息 不可以抽烟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must rest not smoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.27,0:38:49.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的 医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very well, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.82,0:39:08.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 我最亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh my dearest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.97,0:39:11.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对我而言你一天比一天更让我珍爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}every day you become more precious to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.86,0:39:18.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么啦？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.09,0:39:21.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's just that, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.05,0:39:23.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你非去美国不可吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}must you really go to America?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.60,0:39:26.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, my darling, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.63,0:39:29.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只不过是短途旅行罢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's only a short trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.53,0:39:31.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在芝加哥有很重要的金融业务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have important financial business, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.63,0:39:34.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和某些产权需要管理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}certain interests to regulate in Chicago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.16,0:39:35.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过我会很快回来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I shall be back so soon, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.11,0:39:37.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就一眨眼的工夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the twinkle of an eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.60,0:39:40.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚报 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The late editions, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.67,0:39:41.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.00,0:39:43.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看过报纸了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you seen the papers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.68,0:39:45.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那可怜的福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That poor man Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.58,0:39:48.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一天不如一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he sinks daily.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.30,0:39:51.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕你不能指望我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm afraid you cannot expect me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.21,0:39:53.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对福尔摩斯先生和他的不幸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to have very much sympathy with Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.32,0:39:54.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怀有什么同情心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and his misfortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.59,0:39:57.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 得了脑炎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mmm, encephalitis has set in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.67,0:40:03.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你读了新闻吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you seen the news?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.94,0:40:04.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.75,0:40:07.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}星期五格鲁纳 要坐劳拉塔尼亚号去美国了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gruner sales for America on the Ruratania on Friday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.76,0:40:10.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}震撼性的消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}News hits hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.23,0:40:12.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}星期五 那意味着他将从利物浦出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Friday, that means he sails from Liverpool{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.88,0:40:14.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而不是从南安普顿出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not from Southampton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.81,0:40:17.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个小流氓想摆脱我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That little rascal means to get away from us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.33,0:40:18.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是他逃不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but he won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.99,0:40:22.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我发誓他逃不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By the Lord Harry he won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.12,0:40:27.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 我需要你去做件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watson, I need you to do something for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.51,0:40:29.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管差遣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm here to be used.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.58,0:40:31.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那未来的24小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then spend the next 24 hours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.73,0:40:35.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要深入钻研中国瓷器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in an intensive study of Chinese pottery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.02,0:41:17.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哇 1368年到1390年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wow, 1368-1390, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.04,0:42:20.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他睡了 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's sleeping now, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.45,0:42:22.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应该是吗啡的作用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That would be the morphine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.10,0:42:25.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您不会熬通宵吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You won't let the lamp smoke, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.74,0:42:28.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不会的 下面的门锁了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, no, no, you locked up below?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.72,0:42:31.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我刚才锁上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did that a while back, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.10,0:42:32.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}附近可是有杀人凶手啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}there's murderous folk about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.85,0:42:35.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}True, true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.86,0:42:38.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要强迫自己太用功了 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't drive yourself too hard, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.25,0:42:40.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则明天早上你什么也干不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you'll be good for nothing in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.18,0:42:42.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不会的 我就快好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, I shan't be long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.70,0:42:47.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希尔巴顿医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dr. Hill Barton, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.81,0:42:50.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}半月街369号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}369 Half Moon Street, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.05,0:42:51.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}西区的上流社区啊 这人是谁？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mayfair West, who's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.76,0:42:52.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.46,0:42:54.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.38,0:42:57.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是你今晚要用的名字 希尔巴顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is your name this evening, Dr. Hill Barton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.91,0:42:58.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是嘛？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.81,0:43:00.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 而且你将会拜访巴伦 格鲁纳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, and you'll call upon Baron Gruner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.79,0:43:02.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大概在八点半左右{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}about half past eight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.61,0:43:04.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他那时会有空{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He'll be disengaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.61,0:43:07.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已经派人捎去口信 说你会去拜访他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I sent a note telling him that you'll call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.24,0:43:13.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且 你得带上这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Also, that you're bringing this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.05,0:43:20.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这可是真正的明朝青花瓷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is the real eggshell of the Ming Dynasty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.42,0:43:23.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}完整的一套可是价值连城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The complete set would be worth a king's ransom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.40,0:43:25.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是一个收藏家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are a collector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.24,0:43:27.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这套瓷器到了你手里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The set has come your way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.47,0:43:29.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你听说了巴伦的爱好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've heard of the Baron's interest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.95,0:43:32.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}打算把它卖个好价钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and an investor is selling at a price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.43,0:43:34.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么价钱？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What price?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.28,0:43:35.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是你说它举世无双{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will not exaggerate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.31,0:43:37.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也并非夸大其词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if you say it would hardly matched in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.45,0:43:39.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这碗是詹姆斯爵士替我找来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir James got it for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.31,0:43:41.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来自他的一个主顾的收藏品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It comes from a collection of his client.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.88,0:43:43.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或者我可以说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or I could say that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.81,0:43:45.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应该由专家来估价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it should be valued by an expert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.41,0:43:48.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 华生 你今天的脑子真是灵光啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, Watson, you scintillate today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.06,0:43:50.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我建议由苏富比或是克里斯蒂来鉴定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I suggest Sotheby's or Christie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.22,0:43:52.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你肯定他会见我吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're certain he'll see me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.45,0:43:54.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, yes, it's the collection mania{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.95,0:43:57.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他对收藏有着疯狂的热爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in its most acute form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.29,0:43:59.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还要问最后一个问题 福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One last question, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.56,0:44:03.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么你要我冒充一个古董经纪人呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why have you made me a broker in antiques?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.79,0:44:04.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了赢得时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To gain time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.40,0:44:10.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}得到像这样一套瓷器的机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the opportunity to acquire the set such as this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.11,0:44:12.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许会让巴伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}may persuade the Baron{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.17,0:44:15.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}推迟去美国的行程{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to postpone his visit to the United States.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.62,0:44:17.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在我明白了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.28,0:44:20.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}简单的心理学罢了 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Elementary psychology, Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.53,0:44:38.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去金斯顿 司机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kingston please driver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.35,0:45:17.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.85,0:45:27.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very fine indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.84,0:45:37.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是说你有相应的一整套？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you say you have a set to correspond?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.84,0:45:48.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道在英国只有一个可以与它相匹配{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know of only one in England to match it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.27,0:45:55.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是我问你是怎么得到这个的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would it be indiscreet of me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.94,0:45:58.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会不会有些唐突？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if I were to ask how you obtained this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.77,0:46:04.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从哪里得到的真有关系吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does it really matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.19,0:46:07.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然有关系了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course it matters{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.81,0:46:11.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}像这样珍贵的藏品 出处就意味着一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with precious objects such as these provenance is all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.51,0:46:13.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呃 你都看到了 这个可是真品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well you can see the piece is genuine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.59,0:46:17.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至于价值嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As to the value I'm perfectly content{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.44,0:46:19.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请专家来估价最好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to take an expert's assessment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.40,0:46:24.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想你就是专家吧 希尔巴顿医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had supposed you were an expert, Dr. Hill Barton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.48,0:46:28.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说的是中立方的估价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I meant an independent assessment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.24,0:46:29.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然可以了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.20,0:46:36.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我最近刚得到了一些青瓷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have some recently acquired pieces of celadon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.05,0:46:37.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想看看吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you might care to view?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.01,0:46:40.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By all means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.72,0:46:42.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.95,0:46:51.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}完美无瑕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's flawless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.32,0:46:55.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}典型的12世纪的宋代瓷器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Typical 12th Century Sung, I'd say, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.39,0:46:58.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你觉得呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}wouldn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.79,0:47:02.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说得没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.40,0:47:10.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那这个呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.01,0:47:21.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's an excellent example, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.55,0:47:23.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是非常出色的秦朝瓷器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ching Dynasty I should say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.55,0:47:27.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大概在公元265年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}circa 265 A.D.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.86,0:47:30.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}完全正确{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Precisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.77,0:47:39.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那这些呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.40,0:47:41.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}经典的青花瓷 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Typical of celadon would you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.02,0:47:43.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我看看 让我看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give me time, give me time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.39,0:47:45.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会让你看的 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am giving you time, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.70,0:47:47.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quite so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.75,0:47:50.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想听听你对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should also be interested in your views{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.53,0:47:53.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明朝洪武年间瓷器上印记的看法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}on the marks of the Hung Wu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.90,0:47:55.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}洪武瓷器的印记？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Marks of the Hung Wu?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.62,0:47:59.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这可是个争论不休的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That's a vexed question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.25,0:48:02.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确是个争论不休的问题 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vexed question indeed, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.03,0:48:05.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的洪武瓷器是没有印记的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are no marks on the genuine Hung Wu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.59,0:48:07.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是让人难以忍受 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is intolerable, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.90,0:48:09.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来这里是想给你点好处的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I came here to do you a favor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.58,0:48:11.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而不是来做一个受拷问的学童{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not to be examined as if I were a schoolboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.94,0:48:13.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是来这儿侦查{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You came here to spy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.78,0:48:15.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.18,0:48:16.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许你觉得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You may have found it easy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.61,0:48:18.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}撒个谎 伪装个身份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to inveigle your way in here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.38,0:48:20.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进入我的屋子很容易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}upon false pretenses{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.28,0:48:22.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我发誓 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but by god sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.29,0:48:26.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会发现从这儿出去很难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you shall find it harder to get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.21,0:48:30.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把你的手举过头顶 华生医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Raise your hands above your head, Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.11,0:48:34.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.17,0:48:38.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes, you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.83,0:48:40.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不许动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.21,0:48:46.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会射穿你的脑袋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall shoot you through the head{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.85,0:48:48.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而不是心脏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}rather than the heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.12,0:48:52.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后我会告知警方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and inform the police{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.99,0:48:55.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说我把你误认成盗贼了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mistook you for a common burglar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.59,0:48:57.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以前也扮过小偷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is a role that I've played before{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.40,0:49:00.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且还成功了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with some success.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.26,0:49:02.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无疑问 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Without any doubt, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.27,0:49:05.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是你最后一次演出了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this will be your last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.59,0:49:07.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 巴伦 - 基蒂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Baron! - Kitty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.94,0:49:14.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恶有恶报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Be done by your debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.87,0:49:20.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}医生 医生 救我 救我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Doctor, doctor, help me, help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.16,0:49:22.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}打电话给巴伦的医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Telephone the Baron's physician{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.52,0:49:51.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 詹姆斯爵士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, Sir James, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.40,0:49:53.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请原谅我这么晚来打扰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}forgive me for summoning you at this late hour{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.37,0:49:56.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是事情紧急 你必须在苏格兰场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but there's no time to be lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.00,0:49:58.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}掺和进来之前 得到这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must have this before Scotland Yard bumbles in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.14,0:49:59.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}苏格兰场？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Scotland Yard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.17,0:50:03.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巴伦 格鲁纳要指控我们 指控华生冒名顶替{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Baron Gruner's laid a complaint against us, Watson as an impostor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.36,0:50:04.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而我则是入室盗窃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}myself as a burglar, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.31,0:50:05.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们两个都是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we were both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.13,0:50:06.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我转移了格鲁纳的注意力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I diverted Gruner's attention{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.68,0:50:09.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而福尔摩斯则找到了那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}while Holmes procured that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.93,0:50:11.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你必须把这个拿给梅维尔小姐看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must show it to Ms. Merville, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.70,0:50:14.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她会发现自己只是上百个女人之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she will find herself one among a hundred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.56,0:50:16.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巴伦 格鲁纳跟他的女受害人之间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The account of what sports{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.84,0:50:19.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所玩的游戏的记录{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Baron Gruner enjoyed with his female victims{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.00,0:50:22.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许最终可以{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}may have perhaps at last{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.06,0:50:23.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让梅维尔小姐睁开眼睛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}open Ms. Merville's eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.45,0:50:26.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你真是干得太妙了 福尔摩斯先生 太妙了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've done wonders, Holmes, wonders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.28,0:50:29.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了基蒂 温特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Except for Kitty Winter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.11,0:50:31.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生解释吧 我得休息了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watson explain, I must rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.61,0:50:34.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}温特小姐是格鲁纳以前的一个情妇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ms. Winter is a former mistress of Gruner's, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.41,0:50:35.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她跟踪我到了金斯顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she followed me to Kingston, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.51,0:50:37.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}身上藏了一瓶硫酸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}concealed about her was a flask of vitriol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.01,0:50:39.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她把硫酸都泼到格鲁纳身上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Which she unleashed upon Gruner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.69,0:50:42.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的右手严重受伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Severely damaging his right hand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.12,0:50:44.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有他的脸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and parts of his face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.90,0:50:46.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他将终身毁容{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will be disfigured for life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.56,0:50:49.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是如果这些伤{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But surely if these injuries{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.71,0:50:51.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}像你描述的那么可怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}are as terrible as you described them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.92,0:50:54.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我们的目的就达到了啊…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then our purpose is sufficiently gained...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.34,0:50:56.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她会更爱他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She'd love him the more{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.18,0:50:58.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把他当成一个毁了容的殉道者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as a disfigured martyr.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.29,0:51:00.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们应该毁掉的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is his moral side not{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.63,0:51:03.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是他的道德形象而不是他的容貌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}his physical which we have to destroy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.54,0:51:05.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个本子将会让她彻底清醒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That book will bring her down to earth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.57,0:51:06.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想没有别的能做到这一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I knew nothing else that could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.01,0:51:08.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都是他亲手写的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's in his own handwriting, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.64,0:51:10.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她肯定认得出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she cannot get past it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.98,0:51:14.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 我和我的委托人对您感激不尽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Neither my client nor myself can thank you enough, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.89,0:51:16.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是温特小姐甚至是你本人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Should either Ms. Winter or even you yourself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.97,0:51:18.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被警方为难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}be incommoded by the police{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.37,0:51:20.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请马上打电话给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}do not hesitate to telephone me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.01,0:51:22.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 詹姆斯爵士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, Sir James, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.41,0:51:23.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过说实在的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but to tell the truth, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.13,0:51:27.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从未受到苏格兰场的骚扰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I rarely if ever find myself inconvenienced by Scotland Yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.90,0:51:29.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.95,0:51:31.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.00,0:51:38.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得谢谢你 华生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would like to thank you too, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.56,0:51:40.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 詹姆斯爵士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you, Sir James.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.06,0:51:42.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 还有这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, by the way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.08,0:51:45.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明朝的碗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ming dish{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.33,0:51:47.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by jove yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.40,0:51:49.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}价值连城 我想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Worth a king's ransom I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.70,0:51:58.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}(英国皇室徽章){\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.68,0:52:13.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.74,0:52:18.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 我发现我们委托人的身份了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Holmes, I've discovered the identity of our client.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.68,0:52:19.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}原来就是…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's none other than the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.53,0:52:21.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一位忠诚的朋友和一位古道热肠的绅士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A loyal friend and a chivalrous gentleman, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.48,0:52:22.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管是现在还是将来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}let that now and forever{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.85,0:52:25.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们知道这一点就够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}be enough for us.{\r}
